testConfigFlagsCrashLab;variant;r;lib;f;count;st;name_ptr;desc_ptr;name;desc
⍝ Crash-lab for duckdb_get_config_flag NA signatures.
⍝ Default safe mode (variant 0) skips the risky call.
⍝ Set cfgFlagVariant (global) to choose variant:
⍝   0 = safe mode (skip)
⍝   1 = I4 ... U8 >P >P
⍝   2 = I4 ... U8 >U8 >U8
⍝   3 = I4 ... U8 >P[] >P[]
⍝   4 = I4 ... U8 >0UTF8[] >0UTF8[]

:If 0=⎕NC'null'
    init 'lib/'
:EndIf

variant←1
:If 0<⎕NC'cfgFlagVariant'
    variant←cfgFlagVariant
:EndIf

r←⊂'Test Config Flags Crash-Lab (get_config_flag)'
r,←⊂'Selected variant: ',⍕variant

count←configCount
r,←⊂'config_count available: ',⍕count

:If variant=0
    r,←⊂'get_config_flag call skipped (safe mode) - OK'
    ⎕←↑r
    ⎕←''
    ⎕←'Crash-lab complete.'
    →0
:EndIf

lib←ducklibpath

:Trap 0
    :Select variant
    :Case 1
        f←⍎⎕NA'I4 ',lib,'|duckdb_get_config_flag U8 >P >P'
        (st name_ptr desc_ptr)←f 0 0 0
    :Case 2
        f←⍎⎕NA'I4 ',lib,'|duckdb_get_config_flag U8 >U8 >U8'
        (st name_ptr desc_ptr)←f 0 0 0
    :Case 3
        f←⍎⎕NA'I4 ',lib,'|duckdb_get_config_flag U8 >P[] >P[]'
        (st name_ptr desc_ptr)←f 0 0 0
    :Case 4
        f←⍎⎕NA'I4 ',lib,'|duckdb_get_config_flag U8 >0UTF8[] >0UTF8[]'
        (st name desc)←f 0 '' ''
        r,←⊂'get_config_flag call returned - OK'
        r,←⊂'status: ',⍕st
        r,←⊂'name: ',name
        r,←⊂'desc: ',desc
        ⎕←↑r
        ⎕←''
        ⎕←'Crash-lab complete.'
        →0
    :Else
        r,←⊂'Unknown variant - FAILED'
        ⎕←↑r
        ⎕←''
        ⎕←'Crash-lab complete.'
        →0
    :EndSelect

    r,←⊂'get_config_flag call returned - OK'
    r,←⊂'status: ',⍕st
    r,←⊂'name_ptr: ',⍕name_ptr
    r,←⊂'desc_ptr: ',⍕desc_ptr

    :If name_ptr≠0
        name←256 read.utf8 name_ptr
        r,←⊂'name: ',name
    :Else
        r,←⊂'name pointer is null'
    :EndIf
    :If desc_ptr≠0
        desc←512 read.utf8 desc_ptr
        r,←⊂'desc: ',desc
    :Else
        r,←⊂'description pointer is null'
    :EndIf
:Else
    r,←⊂'get_config_flag call failed - FAILED: ',⎕DMX.Message
:EndTrap

⎕←↑r
⎕←''
⎕←'Crash-lab complete.'

⍝ KSL 1.0.0
